{"root":{"data":{"id":"e51df7c33d9b","created":1622421068,"text":"Spring简单理解"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbr09q8s3cw0","created":1622421070182,"text":"核心容器（Core Container）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbr3eqy9rns0","created":1622429926874,"text":"spring-beans(IOC控制翻转DI)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbr4crjc5280","created":1622432592529,"text":"它包含访问配直文件、创建和管理 bean 以及进行\n( IoC/DI ）操作相关的所有类"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr73oc87kw0","created":1622440343621,"text":"核心类","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbr720jrgzc0","created":1622440213470,"text":"AliasRegistry: 定义对 alias 的简单增删改等 操作"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr73exe9680","created":1622440323134,"text":"SimpleAliasRegistry: 主要使用 用map 作为 为alias 的缓，并对接口AliasRegistry行进行实现"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr73icfg680","created":1622440330573,"text":"SingletonBeanRegistry: 定义对单例的注册及获取"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr740ez55k0","created":1622440369909,"text":"DefaultSingletonBeanRegistry: 对接口 SingletonBeanRegistry 各函数的实现。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr7460hfxs0","created":1622440382093,"text":"HierarchicalBeanFactory: 继承 BeanFactory, 也就是在 BeanFactory 定义的功能的基础上增加了对 parentFactory 的支持"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr74afdo2g0","created":1622440391701,"text":"BeanDefinitionRegistry: 定义对 BeanDefinition 的各种增删改操作"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr74dvvq1k0","created":1622440399229,"text":"FactoryBeanRegistrySupport: 在 DefaultSingletonBeanRegistry 基础上增加了对 FactoiyBean 的特殊处理功能"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr74hfadxk0","created":1622440406933,"text":"ConfigurableBeanFactory: 提供配置 Factory 的各种方法。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr74slmq7c0","created":1622440431261,"text":"ListableBeanFactory: 根据各种条件获取 bean 的配置清单。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr74x4dp7c0","created":1622440441102,"text":"AbstractBeanFactory: 综合 FactoryBeanRegistrySupport 和 ConfigurableBeanFactory 的 功能。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr751liif40","created":1622440450845,"text":"AutowireCapableBeanFactory: 提供创建 bean 、自动注入、初始化以及应用 bean 的后 处理器。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr75bih4680","created":1622440472429,"text":"AbstractAutowireCapableBeanFactory: 综合 AbstractBeanFactory 并对接口 Autowire Capable BeanFactory 进行实现。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr75fgfr6g0","created":1622440481013,"text":"ConfigurableListableBeanFactory: BeanFactory 配置清单，指定忽略类型及接口等。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr75j3jw680","created":1622440488941,"text":"DefaultListableBeanFactory: 综合上面所有功能，主要是对 bean 注册后的处理。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbr3ezgalvs0","created":1622429945378,"text":"spring-core"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbr3v2yiqa00","created":1622431206837,"text":"Core 模块是其他纽件的基本核心工具类其他组件都要用到"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbr3fdpn70g0","created":1622429976418,"text":"spring-context"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbr4e7vlxlk0","created":1622432706464,"text":"Context模块构建于 Core和 Beans 模块基础之上，\n提供了一种类似于刑JNDI 注册器的框架式的访问方法,\ncontext基础beans的特性，为spring核心提供大量扩展，\n添加对国际化，事件传播，资源加载和对context的透明创建支持","layout_right_offset":{"x":52.00000923763582,"y":0}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbr3fm82a0w0","created":1622429994946,"text":"spring-expression"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbr3d2fv84w0","created":1622429795154,"text":"AOP和设备支持：spring-aop、spring-aspects、spring-instrument 3个模块组成"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr3d8wunzc0","created":1622429809242,"text":"数据访问及集成：spring-jdbc、spring-tx、spring-orm、spring-oxm、spring-jms五个模块组成。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbr3dfkpxfs0","created":1622429823746,"text":"Web：spring-web、spring-webmvc、spring-websocket、spring-webflux 四个模块组成"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}